{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"5050","name":"娜丝琳【巡林员】","desc":"娜丝琳【巡林员】","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/19/75981509/95e80f94c5617c1eaa176444210caa7b_4914886808658082464.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"娜丝琳","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"女\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"化城郭\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"巡林员\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"编者注：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e我⋯听⋯不⋯见\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"心声：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e林中那些修行的学者⋯得盯紧点。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/19/75981509/8b7a6c1feb149e0670fae52416e14d0a_8642617199581034291.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC截图\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/19/75981509/422b1478e5a864ad77cc4b145c48d8f5_4024913725718028906.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/19/75981509/a1ac2930197ddf9d7795b6131434a1b4_5911462177142117791.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e找⋯什⋯事吗？⋯讲。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【冒险挑战】——进行七圣召唤对局【牌手七级解锁】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【胜利】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e难道还是不够复杂吗···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【失败】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e感觉你需要再认真读读「七圣召唤」的规则书啊···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【呃⋯你好？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e啊，抱歉⋯是不是我说话声音太小，你听不清啊？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e咳咳。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e我是想说：找我有什么事吗？请讲。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【是不是打扰你了？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e不是你的问题，是我的老毛病啦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e我因为常常去野外打猎，而且偶尔会遇见在林中修行的学者，所以习惯了轻声细语，一时改不过来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e有很多人因为这个，误以为我性格内向，和我说话时都小心翼翼的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e其实没必要，请和我正常讲话就好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【关于修行的学者⋯】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e这个啊，虽然他们人数不多，而且地点隐蔽，但你如果常年混迹道成林的话，总能遇见的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e说实话，具体原理我也不是特别清楚。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e只知道这种情况叫什么林中⋯什么什么语期？是学者们修行的特殊环节，不可以去贸然打扰。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e所以我有时挺担心那个没经验的见习巡林员可能会不懂规矩，打扰到教令院的学者们。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e嗯⋯不过既然她是跟着巡林官的，应该不至于像没读过《雨林生存指南》的那些人一样莽撞吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【再⋯见？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e⋯见。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"【冒险挑战】：巡林员的一日工作","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"娜丝琳\",\"created_at\":\"2022-12-31\",\"list\":[{\"energy_bg\":0,\"ep_id\":5593,\"img\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/31/160491137/4af7a4b79186af6c8dbfd9609